== Notes ==

* This spell inflicts [[positive energy damage]] on a targeted undead, unless the creature is [[PvP setting#Reactions|friendly]] to the caster.
* [[Module]] creators sometimes change this spell to provide an amount of healing dependent on [[caster level]]. Similarly, its effectiveness against undead is also sometimes toned down.
* Due to a .2da bug, ''harm'' is not an additional [[counterspell]] of this spell.

